  "rationale": "Setting skip_qiime to true disables both run_qiime2_taxonomy and run_qiime2, eliminating QIIME2 classification, downstream analyses and their associated auxiliary processes while preserving DADA2 taxonomy classification. PHYLOSEQ and TREESUMMARIZEDEXPERIMENT instead receive the pre-QIIME2 ASV abundance table, original metadata and no phylogenetic tree, while MULTIQC and SUMMARY_REPORT receive changed reporting inputs. SUMMARY_TABLE_TAXONOMY and DUCKDB_TABLE2PARQUET retain their unchanged DADA2-related tasks and lose their QIIME2-related tasks, which does not require re-execution of their remaining tasks; feasibility is predicted from the supplied source code rather than verified through execution."
